  "summary": "KESTREL Company must hold PASS NANDI against a hostile infiltration while the ridge itself cuts radio line-of-sight. GPS spoofing walks PL A off the map, a key report on a hostile supply convoy arrives five minutes late, and the pass and the forward supply dump cannot both be held by the same platoon.",
