    "mission": "KESTREL Company holds PASS NANDI (D5) until T+25 to deny the valley route, and protects the forward supply dump (B7).",
    "execution": "KESTREL 1 (PL A) holds the observation post at E2 forward of the ridge and reports. KESTREL 2 (PL B) holds C6 covering both the pass approach and the dump. HAWK 1 (ALO) controls UAV RAVEN and the single CAS sortie. SPECTRE (EW) manages PACE and can move the rebro onto the ridge to restore VHF.",
    "sustainment": "Forward supply dump at B7. Runners from B4.",
    "command": "PACE: CMD NET → alternate net → HF NET → RUNNER. Expect VHF to fail across the ridge — plan relays. If cut off, act on the commander's intent."
